{"kind":"stack","id":"s1","title":"Food chains: producers, predators and prey","theme":{"background":"#f3f9ee","foreground":"#1f3b1f","font":"Georgia, serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"image","id":"c1-p","picto":"leaf"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-t","content":"Producer"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-e","content":"A living thing that makes its own food using sunlight. Plants are producers."},{"type":"button","id":"c1-b","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"image","id":"c2-p","picto":"fish"},{"type":"text","id":"c2-t","content":"Predator"},{"type":"text","id":"c2-e","content":"An animal that hunts and eats other animals. The animal it eats is called its prey."},{"type":"button","id":"c2-b","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"In the food chain grass, rabbit, fox, what is the grass?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"A predator","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"A producer","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"A predator's prey","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-q","content":"In a food chain, which way do the arrows point?"},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a","label":"From the eater to the food it eats","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"From the food to the animal that eats it","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-c","label":"In both directions at once","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"image","id":"c5-p","picto":"river"},{"type":"text","id":"c5-t","content":"A frog lives by a river. A heron has arrived. Which path will the frog take?"},{"type":"button","id":"c5-a","label":"Hide in the reeds","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"Jump into the water","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-t","content":"The frog hides among the reeds. The heron passes by. The frog is safe and keeps eating insects."},{"type":"button","id":"c6-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-t","content":"The frog jumps into the river. It swims away fast, but it is hard to find food in deep water."},{"type":"button","id":"c7-b","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-q","content":"In the food chain sun, grass, grasshopper, frog, which animal is the prey?"},{"type":"button","id":"c8-a","label":"The frog","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c8-b","label":"The grasshopper","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c8-c","label":"The grass","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c8-d","label":"The sun","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-q","content":"Which of these is a food chain?"},{"type":"button","id":"c9-a","label":"Rabbit, grass, fox","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-b","label":"Grass, rabbit, fox","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-c","label":"Fox, grass, rabbit","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c10","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c10-q","content":"Which animal in a food chain is always a predator?"},{"type":"button","id":"c10-a","label":"The owl","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"sound","sound":"cheer"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-b","label":"The mouse","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-c","label":"The seed","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"sound","sound":"buzz"},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c11","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c11-h","content":"Well done! You finished food chains."},{"type":"text","id":"c11-m","content":"You can now name producers, predators and prey, and read the arrows in a food chain. Keep looking for food chains in nature."}],"actions":[]}}
